  "text": "What would you like to do with your ending?\n\nEveryone has agreed to our gathering plan.\n\nLet’s start after the last boat returns.\n\nAre you making bread for the gathering?\n\nChoose the part your picture will show.\n\nReview the gathering plan with Grandma\n\nChoose what Mara’s lantern will show.\n\nHow will Pip help prepare the bread?\n\n“Could you leave a little earlier?”\n\nChoose the moment you want to keep.\n\nWhat would you like Sol to do next?\n\nI can help you get the bread ready.\n\nHow will you carry Mara’s message?\n\nI can bring the spare tile to Sol.\n\nAdd and share the thank-you ending\n\nYou are Pip. Choose your response.\n\nLet’s finish the ending together.\n\nWe’re starting at the usual time.\n\nI can read your story to Grandma.\n\nWatch Mara help these passengers\n\nShare The Torn Wing with Grandma\n\nTell Grandma everyone has agreed\n\nWhat would you like to do next?\n\nPlan the gathering with Grandma\n\nLet Grandma know what Mara said\n\nWhen will the gathering start?\n\nTell Grandma in your own words\n\nAdd and share the bread ending\n\nWho will share The Torn Wing?\n\nMay I take your page to read?\n\nDid you hear from Rina again?\n\nLoad the seed into the boat\n\nTell Grandma what Mara said\n\nTell Grandma your message.\n\nPlanting the seed together\n\nHow will you tell Grandma?\n\nUse Mara’s message instead\n\nWatch the empty seed boat\n\nContinue talking with Sol\n\nRead the garden’s stories\n\nTry baking the whole lump\n\nShare The Torn Wing again\n\nReady to make the dough?\n\nGive Grandma Mara’s page\n\nMake the dough with Rina\n\nTake a loaf to thank Sol\n\nLet Rina check the flour\n\nA gift repaired together\n\nKeep the draft as it is\n\nA promise to his sister\n\nRead Mara’s story again\n\nMake a different choice\n\nPlay from the beginning\n\nI’ll look around first.\n\nWhat will Pip do next?\n\nReady to help Grandma?\n\nContinue the gathering",
